{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Cancel the 4% Increase in Tax on Savings Interest scheduled for April 2027",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "The tax rates on income from savings interest are scheduled to increase by 4% from April 2027 on all rates. \r\n\r\nThis will take the basic rate of tax from 20% to 24%. \r\n\r\nWe object to this 4% raise on all rates from April 2027 and call on the Government to cancel this scheduled increase.",
